description:
Turn the lesson's questions into a function:

```cpp
struct Needs
{
    bool otherLanguages{ false };      // other languages or teams' programs call it
    bool loadWhileRunning{ false };    // plugins, mods, hot reload
    bool updateSeparately{ false };    // replaced without rebuilding programs
    bool mostlyTemplates{ false };
    bool small{ false };
};

std::string choosePackage(const Needs& needs);
```

Return `"DLL with a C interface"` if other languages call it; otherwise `"DLL"` if it must load while running or update separately; otherwise `"header-only"` if it is mostly templates or small; otherwise `"static library"`.

